 "remarks": "Enjoy elevated living in this beautifully updated, top-floor one-bedroom apartment featuring stunning city skyline views! The updated kitchen and beautifully renovated bathrooms create a fresh, modern feel, while the private patio offers a charming spot to relax on the bench and take in the surrounding views.  Location, convenience, and lifestyle come together here. Enjoy nearby restaurants, a park directly across the street, and the convenience of walking to the train station. Commuting to NYC is a breeze, making this an excellent choice for anyone seeking a comfortable home with easy access to the city.  Additional highlights include:  Top-floor apartment with beautiful skyline views  One spacious bedroom  Updated kitchen and renovated bathrooms  Private patio with a bench and city views  Park conveniently located across the street  Restaurants and train station within walking distance  Easy commute to New York City  Heat included in the rent  Garage parking available for an additional $80 per month  Discover the perfect combination of modern updates, city views, and commuter-friendly convenience at 444 Bedford Road!",
